diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 835cfa3..87cb35d 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,15 @@
 
 All notable, unreleased changes to this project will be documented in this file. For the released changes, please visit the [Releases](https://github.com/saleor/saleor/releases) page.
 
+# 3.24.0
+
+### GraphQL API
+
+- Added optional per-product age restriction. `Product.minimumAge` field and `minimumAge` input on `productCreate`, `productUpdate` and `productBulkCreate` (must be between 1 and 120; `null` means no restriction). Checkout line mutations, `checkoutComplete`, `orderCreateFromCheckout`, `checkoutPaymentCreate`, `transactionInitialize`/`transactionProcess`, `draftOrderComplete` and `orderConfirm` reject customers that are too young or whose date of birth is unknown, with the new `CUSTOMER_TOO_YOUNG` and `CUSTOMER_AGE_UNKNOWN` error codes (added to `CheckoutErrorCode`, `OrderCreateFromCheckoutErrorCode`, `OrderErrorCode`, `TransactionInitializeErrorCode`, `TransactionProcessErrorCode`). `checkoutPaymentCreate` is gated the same way (`PaymentErrorCode.CUSTOMER_TOO_YOUNG`/`CUSTOMER_AGE_UNKNOWN`, no payment is created).
+- Added `Shop.timeZone` and `Shop.minimumAge` fields (`MANAGE_SETTINGS`) and the matching `ShopSettingsInput.timeZone` and `ShopSettingsInput.minimumAge` inputs. The time zone determines the current date for age checks; the shop minimum age drives `User.ageEligible`.
+- Added `User.dateOfBirth`, `User.ageEligible` and `User.isSuperuser` fields, and the `dateOfBirth` input on `accountUpdate` (`AccountInput`), `customerCreate` and `customerUpdate`. The date of birth is visible only to the account owner and to superusers, is never exposed to apps, and can be written by superusers or by the owner only. Rejected writes return the new `DATE_OF_BIRTH_EDIT_NOT_ALLOWED` code on `AccountErrorCode` and `CustomerBulkUpdateErrorCode`.
+- Added `DATE_OF_BIRTH_CHANGED` and `DATE_OF_BIRTH_VIEWED` values to `CustomerEventsEnum`. Changes to and superuser reads of a customer's date of birth are recorded in the customer events.
+
 # 3.23.0
 
 ### Breaking changes
