+- Enforced in checkout line add/update/create, `checkoutComplete`, `orderCreateFromCheckout`, `transactionInitialize/Process`, order line edits, `draftOrderComplete`, `orderConfirm`; new `CUSTOMER_TOO_YOUNG`/`CUSTOMER_AGE_UNKNOWN` codes. Buyer = `checkout.user`/`order.user` FK only.
+- API: `Product.minimumAge`, `Shop.timeZone/minimumAge`, `User.dateOfBirth/ageEligible/isSuperuser`, `dateOfBirth` inputs; DOB visible to owner/superuser only, never apps; audit events `DATE_OF_BIRTH_CHANGED/VIEWED`; DOB masked in observability, excluded from search. See `CHANGELOG.md` 3.24.0, `schema.graphql` (additive only).
+- Full suite caveat: with `-n auto`, transactional tests may error at DB flush ("out of shared memory", local Postgres `max_locks_per_transaction`); they pass with `-n 0`.
